<title>ARGENTINA: RALLYING-ARGENTINE RALLY PLACINGS AFTER FOUR STAGES.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-ARGENTINE RALLY PLACINGS AFTER FOUR STAGES.</headline>
<dateline>CORDOBA, Argentina 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in</p>
<p>the Rally of Argentina after four stages on Thursday:</p>
<p>  1. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi	 35:48</p>
<p>  2. Richard Burns (Britain) Mitsubishi	 35:54</p>
<p>  3 equal. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru	 36:00</p>
<p>  3 equal. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford	    36:00</p>
<p>  5. Juha Kankunnen (Finland) Ford		36:14</p>
<p>  6. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru	   36:18</p>
<p>  7. Marcus Gronholm (Finland) Toyota	   36:44</p>
